					<p><img decoding="async" fetchpriority="high" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-83193" title="Water Wall Display: 3 Things You Should Know About Them And Feng Shui" src="/wp-content/uploads/Water-Wall-Display-3-Things-You-Should-Know-About-Them-And-Feng-Shui.jpg" alt="Water Wall Display: 3 Things You Should Know About Them And Feng Shui" width="1200" height="800" /></p>
<p>Water is one of the 5 elements through which we achieve harmony in our life. Custom Water Features attract wealth, prosperity, and abundance. And it is that, who does not relax listening to the water displays? If you close your eyes and imagine a small Curtain Waterfall surrounded in your room, it transmits immense peace and serenity.</p>
<p>As we have already told you other times, Feng Shui tries to connect us with nature through the objects that we have at our place. One of the objects you can use as a water element is the Feng Shui Custom Water Walls or Water Displays.</p>
<p><strong>Is </strong><strong>Waterfall Elevator </strong><strong>essential to have a good Feng Shui</strong>?</p>
<p><strong>?</strong>The answer is very simple: no. You will think that how can this be possible, water being one of the five elements with which we achieve harmony. This is because if you do not like water sources, it is better not to have them.</p>
<p>A water source is one of the possible elements, but not the only one. You can get the water element in another way, such as with the DIY Bubble Wall. But if you have a Curtain Waterfall that you buy because somewhere you have read that it is good for Feng Shui, knowing that it is an object that does not go with you or your decoration will become unused junk.</p>
<p>KEY: If you want to know how to achieve personal, family tranquility and abundance through small changes in your home, without having to reform it or change your decoration, you need to take a look at this little gift that I have prepared for you. Click on Bubble Walls For Sale now.</p>
<p><strong>Surround yourself with only what you need, and it makes you happy.</strong></p>
<p>Custom Water Feature that is clogged, not used, and with stagnant water due to lack of use will only paralyze the energy of the room where you have it and thus affect the Bagua area where it is located. In the attempt to want to do a good Feng Shui, you will achieve the opposite. In short, water displays, but only if you like them and will put them in motion.</p>
<p><strong>Two characteristics when choosing Feng Shui </strong><strong>Water Displays</strong></p>
<p>Water is a very powerful element in Feng Shui. Therefore, if you have decided to get a Water Display because you like it, here are some guidelines that you should keep in mind:</p>
<p><strong>The shape and what it represents:</strong></p>
<p>In this case, you should pay close attention to the room where you want to place it and if that font makes sense with the rest of the decorative objects.</p>
<p><strong>Sound:</strong></p>
<p>Once you have chosen your ideal Glass wall fountain, now you have to consider the sound of the water falling. Do you like it? Find a sound that pleases you and relaxes you. Of course, you also have to take into account the engine noise. It often happens that, in small Custom Water Walls, the sound of the motor is louder than that of the water jump. This you should avoid. Find some Feng Shui Water Displays with which you can only hear the relaxing noise of the waterfall.</p>
<p><strong>The size:</strong></p>
<p>You must follow your intuition again since no size is the most recommended, but it is a matter of taste and the place where you want to place it.</p>
<p>Outdoor Water Displays will always be larger than an indoor one, and the sound of falling water will also be louder. Inside, for space, the Feng Shui water fountain will be smaller, logically. But we encourage you not to be conditioned by this.</p>
